      "writtenOn": "2020-02-12T17:12:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IIUC the IKE lib guarantees this can\u0027t happen – it would require it calls you to tell you of the failure, THEN calls you again saying a child transform was created for this session, which would be a bug in the IKE lib.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2158,
